@StudentPortal_HostAddress = https://localhost:7155

### GET - Get all students
GET {{StudentPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Accept: application/json

###

### POST - Add a new student
POST {{StudentPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Rahul",
  "course": "ECE",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543211"
}

###

### PUT - Update an existing student
PUT {{StudentPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentName": "Rahul Kumar",
  "course": "CSE",
  "location": "Hyderabad",
  "email": "rahulkumar@gmail.com",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543211"
}

###

### DELETE - Delete an existing student
DELETE {{StudentPortal_HostAddress}}/api/Students/1
Accept: application/json